{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48841","headline":"中秋夜洞庭圆月 · 姚合","name":"中秋夜洞庭圆月","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素月闲秋景，骚人泛洞庭。\n沧波正澄霁，凉叶未飘零。\n练彩凝葭菼，霜容静杳冥。\n晓栖河畔鹤，宵映渚边萤。\n圆彩含珠魄，微颷发桂馨。\n谁怜采苹客，此夜宿孤汀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}